       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SALES-REPORT.
      * Report Writer: control breaks (FINAL, REGION, SALESMAN), SUM with
      * rolling and RESET, GROUP INDICATE, REPORT and PAGE HEADING and
      * FOOTING, NEXT GROUP, USE BEFORE REPORTING with SUPPRESS PRINTING.
      * The report is read back and shown.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT REPORT-FILE ASSIGN TO "sales-report.txt".
           SELECT REPORT-IN ASSIGN TO "sales-report.txt"
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  REPORT-FILE
           REPORT IS SALES.
       FD  REPORT-IN.
       01  REPORT-IN-LINE   PIC X(60).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SALES-DATA.
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "NORTH ADAMS   012500".
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "NORTH ADAMS   003075".
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "NORTH BAKER   010000".
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "NORTH BAKER   000000".
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "SOUTH CLARK   020000".
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "SOUTH CLARK   001050".
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "SOUTH CLARK   000999".
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "SOUTH DAVIS   030000".
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "WEST  EVANS   004000".
           05  FILLER PIC X(20) VALUE "WEST  EVANS   004500".
       01  SALES-TABLE REDEFINES SALES-DATA.
           05  SALE OCCURS 10 TIMES.
               10  REGION     PIC X(6).
               10  SALESMAN   PIC X(8).
               10  AMOUNT     PIC 9(4)V99.
       01  CURRENT-SALE.
           05  CUR-REGION     PIC X(6).
           05  CUR-SALESMAN   PIC X(8).
           05  CUR-AMOUNT     PIC 9(4)V99.
       01  I                  PIC 99.
       01  EOF-FLAG           PIC X VALUE "N".
       REPORT SECTION.
       RD  SALES
           CONTROLS ARE FINAL CUR-REGION CUR-SALESMAN
           PAGE LIMIT IS 24 LINES
           HEADING 1
           FIRST DETAIL 6
           LAST DETAIL 19
           FOOTING 21.
       01  TYPE IS REPORT HEADING.
           05  LINE 1  COLUMN 10  PIC X(20) VALUE "QUARTERLY SALES".
       01  TYPE IS PAGE HEADING.
           05  LINE 3.
               10  COLUMN 1   PIC X(6)  VALUE "REGION".
               10  COLUMN 9   PIC X(8)  VALUE "SALESMAN".
               10  COLUMN 22  PIC X(6)  VALUE "AMOUNT".
               10  COLUMN 35  PIC X(5)  VALUE "PAGE ".
               10  COLUMN 40  PIC Z9    SOURCE PAGE-COUNTER.
           05  LINE 4  COLUMN 1  PIC X(41) VALUE ALL "-".
       01  TYPE IS CONTROL HEADING CUR-REGION LINE PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(6)  SOURCE CUR-REGION.
       01  SALE-LINE TYPE IS DETAIL LINE PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 9   PIC X(8)  SOURCE CUR-SALESMAN GROUP INDICATE.
           05  COLUMN 18  PIC Z,ZZ9.99  SOURCE CUR-AMOUNT.
       01  TYPE IS CONTROL FOOTING CUR-SALESMAN LINE PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 9   PIC X(8)  VALUE "  TOTAL".
           05  SALESMAN-TOTAL COLUMN 17  PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99  SUM CUR-AMOUNT.
       01  TYPE IS CONTROL FOOTING CUR-REGION
           LINE PLUS 1  NEXT GROUP PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 1   PIC X(6)  SOURCE CUR-REGION.
           05  COLUMN 9   PIC X(5)  VALUE "TOTAL".
           05  REGION-TOTAL COLUMN 16  PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99
                   SUM SALESMAN-TOTAL.
       01  TYPE IS CONTROL FOOTING FINAL LINE PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 1   PIC X(11) VALUE "GRAND TOTAL".
           05  COLUMN 16  PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99  SUM REGION-TOTAL.
       01  TYPE IS PAGE FOOTING LINE 23.
           05  COLUMN 30  PIC X(8) VALUE "-- PAGE".
           05  COLUMN 38  PIC Z9  SOURCE PAGE-COUNTER.
       01  TYPE IS REPORT FOOTING LINE PLUS 1.
           05  COLUMN 10  PIC X(13) VALUE "END OF REPORT".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       DECLARATIVES.
       ZERO-SALES SECTION.
           USE BEFORE REPORTING SALE-LINE.
       ZERO-CHECK.
           IF CUR-AMOUNT = ZERO SUPPRESS PRINTING.
       END DECLARATIVES.
       MAIN SECTION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           OPEN OUTPUT REPORT-FILE.
           INITIATE SALES.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 10
               MOVE SALE (I) TO CURRENT-SALE
               GENERATE SALE-LINE
           END-PERFORM.
           TERMINATE SALES.
           CLOSE REPORT-FILE.
           DISPLAY "PAGES " PAGE-COUNTER " LAST LINE " LINE-COUNTER.
           OPEN INPUT REPORT-IN.
           PERFORM UNTIL EOF-FLAG = "Y"
               READ REPORT-IN
                   AT END MOVE "Y" TO EOF-FLAG
                   NOT AT END DISPLAY "|" REPORT-IN-LINE "|"
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM.
           CLOSE REPORT-IN.
           STOP RUN.
